<title>USA: AT&amp;T completes NCR spin-off.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T completes NCR spin-off.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecommunications giant AT&amp;T Corp. said Wednesday it has distributed more than 100 million shares of common stock in computer company NCR Corp. to AT&amp;T shareowners, finalising the spin-off of NCR.</p>
<p>As previously announced, the distribution of 101,437,174.688 shares was on the basis of 0.0625 a share of NCR for each AT&amp;T share outstanding.</p>
